  "title": "Hamilton Appoints Mike Mulray as Chief Underwriting Officer of Hamilton Select",
  "summary": "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA, October 13, 2025 — Hamilton Insurance Group, Ltd. (NYSE: HG) (“Hamilton” or the “Company”) announced today the appointment of Mike Mulray as Chief Underwriting Officer at Hamilton Select, its US excess and surplus (E&S) lines insurer, effective October 20, 2025. In his new role, Mulray will lead the underwriting operations of Hamilton Select, […]",
